  "code": 200,
  "msg": "成功",
  "data": {
    "id": 3030,
    "type": "help",
    "format": "markdown",
    "alias": "",
    "title": "小程序注册流程",
    "keywords": "小程序注册流程",
    "description": "",
    "content": "<p>各位老板们在开通智慧微店之前，要先在微信公众平台上注册小程序。</p>\n<h2 id=\"%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E5%B0%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%B8%90%E5%8F%B7\" tabindex=\"-1\">注册小程序帐号<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E5%B0%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%B8%90%E5%8F%B7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"%E5%95%86%E5%AE%B6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%85%AC%E4%BC%97%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5%EF%BC%88https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2F%EF%BC%89%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E5%8F%B3%E4%B8%8A%E8%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E2%80%9D%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%EF%BC%9B%E5%A6%82%E5%9B%BE%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%9A\" tabindex=\"-1\">商家需要打开微信公众平台官网首页（https://mp.weixin.qq.com/）点击右上角的“立即注册”按钮；如图展示：<img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/75139ee6faa76f7c9b9a9c4ca0512fd9.png\" alt=\"Description\"><a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%95%86%E5%AE%B6%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%89%93%E5%BC%80%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%85%AC%E4%BC%97%E5%B9%B3%E5%8F%B0%E5%AE%98%E7%BD%91%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5%EF%BC%88https%3A%2F%2Fmp.weixin.qq.com%2F%EF%BC%89%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E5%8F%B3%E4%B8%8A%E8%A7%92%E7%9A%84%E2%80%9C%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E2%80%9D%E6%8C%89%E9%92%AE%EF%BC%9B%E5%A6%82%E5%9B%BE%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%9A\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<h3 id=\"%E6%8E%A5%E7%9D%80%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E2%80%9C%E5%B0%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%9B%E7%82%B9%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%8F%B7%E3%80%81%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E5%8F%B7%E3%80%81%E5%B0%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8E%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E3%80%82\" tabindex=\"-1\">接着选择“小程序”；点这里查看服务号、订阅号、小程序与企业微信的区别。<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%8E%A5%E7%9D%80%E9%80%89%E6%8B%A9%E2%80%9C%E5%B0%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E2%80%9D%EF%BC%9B%E7%82%B9%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E5%8F%B7%E3%80%81%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E5%8F%B7%E3%80%81%E5%B0%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E4%B8%8E%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E7%9A%84%E5%8C%BA%E5%88%AB%E3%80%82\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<h3 id=\"%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%B0%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E7%AE%AD%E5%A4%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9-%3E%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95\" tabindex=\"-1\">填写账号基本信息，包含邮箱，密码。如已有微信小程序，可点击箭头指向的地方-&gt;立即登录<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E5%8C%85%E5%90%AB%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1%EF%BC%8C%E5%AF%86%E7%A0%81%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%E5%B7%B2%E6%9C%89%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%B0%8F%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E7%AE%AD%E5%A4%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%90%91%E7%9A%84%E5%9C%B0%E6%96%B9-%3E%E7%AB%8B%E5%8D%B3%E7%99%BB%E5%BD%95\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/c93d5c3f09f4aaa723443dd03dc28f50.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%B0%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7\" tabindex=\"-1\">激活：到邮箱激活注册账号<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%EF%BC%9A%E5%88%B0%E9%82%AE%E7%AE%B1%E6%BF%80%E6%B4%BB%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/f91e287c07717e31bef5967a4cbd043a.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h2 id=\"%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF\" tabindex=\"-1\">填写基本信息<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E5%9F%BA%E6%9C%AC%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h2>\n<h3 id=\"%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%E5%9B%BE%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E9%A1%B9%E9%83%BD%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E3%80%82%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E8%A6%81%E9%80%89%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%81\" tabindex=\"-1\">企业信息，主体信息，管理员信息。如图展示的信息，需要按照操作流程每一项都填写。注意：这里主体类型要选企业！！！！<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E3%80%82%E5%A6%82%E5%9B%BE%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%E7%9A%84%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B%E6%AF%8F%E4%B8%80%E9%A1%B9%E9%83%BD%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E3%80%82%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E8%BF%99%E9%87%8C%E4%B8%BB%E4%BD%93%E7%B1%BB%E5%9E%8B%E8%A6%81%E9%80%89%E4%BC%81%E4%B8%9A%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%81%EF%BC%81\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/021443f134c3712b9362907a86890d32.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p>信息填写完了后，还需要对主体进行验证，可以通过小额打款或者微信认证的方式（两种方式任选一种，建议选择微信认证过程相对简单快捷。）勾选一下就可以了。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202508/e056801fe0afbf3595e13548fa7c6f5c.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E5%A5%BD%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E4%BA%8C%E7%BB%B4%E7%A0%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%AB%E7%A0%81%E7%9A%84%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%B0%86%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%A5%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E5%9B%BE%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E3%80%82\" tabindex=\"-1\">填写好相关资料信息之后，需要使用管理员本人微信扫描二维码，注册之后，扫码的微信号将成为该账号的管理员微信号，如图：注意：绑定管理员时，微信号必须已经绑定管理员本人银行卡，完成微信个人认证。<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E5%A1%AB%E5%86%99%E5%A5%BD%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%B5%84%E6%96%99%E4%BF%A1%E6%81%AF%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E9%9C%80%E8%A6%81%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E4%BA%8C%E7%BB%B4%E7%A0%81%EF%BC%8C%E6%B3%A8%E5%86%8C%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%AB%E7%A0%81%E7%9A%84%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%B0%86%E6%88%90%E4%B8%BA%E8%AF%A5%E8%B4%A6%E5%8F%B7%E7%9A%84%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%EF%BC%8C%E5%A6%82%E5%9B%BE%EF%BC%9A%E6%B3%A8%E6%84%8F%EF%BC%9A%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E6%97%B6%EF%BC%8C%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E5%8F%B7%E5%BF%85%E9%A1%BB%E5%B7%B2%E7%BB%8F%E7%BB%91%E5%AE%9A%E7%AE%A1%E7%90%86%E5%91%98%E6%9C%AC%E4%BA%BA%E9%93%B6%E8%A1%8C%E5%8D%A1%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E5%BE%AE%E4%BF%A1%E4%B8%AA%E4%BA%BA%E8%AE%A4%E8%AF%81%E3%80%82\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/1838fbcfaa8a7fc3296862e3b790629b.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E7%AB%AF%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E4%BA%8C%E7%BB%B4%E7%A0%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF\" tabindex=\"-1\">手机端扫描二维码之后，出现以下图片，按照操作提示操作即可<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E7%AB%AF%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E4%BA%8C%E7%BB%B4%E7%A0%81%E4%B9%8B%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%87%BA%E7%8E%B0%E4%BB%A5%E4%B8%8B%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%EF%BC%8C%E6%8C%89%E7%85%A7%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E6%8F%90%E7%A4%BA%E6%93%8D%E4%BD%9C%E5%8D%B3%E5%8F%AF\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/6b5e292535f140c82d8b538ebe88f4a7.png\" alt=\"Description\"><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/c7389a047104810b9ae61825c4304913.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E5%8E%9F%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E5%A6%82%E5%9B%BE%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%9A\" tabindex=\"-1\">手机扫描完成，返回原页面，完成页面如图展示：<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E6%89%8B%E6%9C%BA%E6%89%AB%E6%8F%8F%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%EF%BC%8C%E8%BF%94%E5%9B%9E%E5%8E%9F%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%EF%BC%8C%E5%AE%8C%E6%88%90%E9%A1%B5%E9%9D%A2%E5%A6%82%E5%9B%BE%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%EF%BC%9A\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/880054f9eeb2236e32aea3da7ec57750.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E2%80%9C%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E2%80%9D\" tabindex=\"-1\">点击“继续”<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E2%80%9C%E7%BB%A7%E7%BB%AD%E2%80%9D\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/b0da9800047f71621b780fad5a019b53.png\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<h3 id=\"%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A\" tabindex=\"-1\">点击确定<a class=\"header-anchor\" href=\"#%E7%82%B9%E5%87%BB%E7%A1%AE%E5%AE%9A\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></a></h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://ks3-cn-beijing.ksyun.com/zhjwebsite/uploads/202506/f2b5d350886c026de4575a0ead1ea53b.png\" alt=\"Description\">\n*此处的对公账户：注册企业/媒体/其他组织类型小程序需对公账户，请先办理对公账号再进行注册。个体工商户无对公账户，可填写个体工商户营业执照上经营者个人开户名称，填写个人银行卡号时需与营业执照上法人保持一致。对公账户填写错误，不支持修改，若填写错误，请在10天注册超时后登录帐号重填或重新注册。</p>\n<p>【重要】</p>\n<p>微信小程序在提交审核之前，必须设置小程序名称、头像、简介，以及服务类目。很多用户会忽略服务类目的设置，但是在微信审核过程中，服务类目审核是最重要的一个环节，服务类目须与上架商品一致，请务必重视。 如何设置或修改类目：1.登录小程序账号 2.进入设置-基本设置 3.服务类目条目中进行修改。</p>\n<p>完成以上步骤，接下去就是给小程序做微信认证了。</p>\n",
